---
// 50 one-second requests. Numbers from the /threadpool-limit capture:
// 40 threads, plain def 2.04 s (two rounds), async await 1.06 s.
const W = 900, H = 330;
const X0 = 250, PER_S = 280; // 0..2.1 s
---
<figure class="bep6j">
  <div class="bep6j-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Fifty one-second requests. Plain def with 40 threads: 40 requests run in the first second, the other 10 wait for a free thread and run in the second round, total 2.04 seconds. async def with await: all 50 overlap, total 1.06 seconds.">
    {[0, 0.5, 1, 1.5, 2].map((t) => <line x1={X0 + t * PER_S} y1="40" x2={X0 + t * PER_S} y2="236" class="grid" />)}

    <text x="20" y="84" class="code">def</text>
    <text x="20" y="106" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>40-thread pool</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>pool 40 thread</tspan></text>
    <rect x={X0} y="62" width={1.03 * PER_S - 2} height="34" rx="4" class="ok" />
    <text x={X0 + 0.515 * PER_S} y="84" text-anchor="middle" class="v"><tspan data-lang-en>40 requests</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>40 request</tspan></text>
    <rect x={X0 + 1.03 * PER_S} y="62" width={1.01 * PER_S} height="34" rx="4" class="bad" />
    <text x={X0 + 1.535 * PER_S} y="84" text-anchor="middle" class="vr"><tspan data-lang-en>10 had to wait</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>10 phải chờ</tspan></text>
    <text x={X0 + 2.04 * PER_S + 12} y="84" class="vr">2.04 s</text>

    <text x="20" y="174" class="code">async def</text>
    <text x="20" y="196" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>+ await</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>+ await</tspan></text>
    <rect x={X0} y="152" width={1.06 * PER_S} height="34" rx="4" class="ok" />
    <text x={X0 + 0.53 * PER_S} y="174" text-anchor="middle" class="v"><tspan data-lang-en>all 50 overlap</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cả 50 chồng lên nhau</tspan></text>
    <text x={X0 + 1.06 * PER_S + 12} y="174" class="v">1.06 s</text>

    <line x1={X0} y1="236" x2={X0 + 2.1 * PER_S} y2="236" class="axis" />
    {[0, 0.5, 1, 1.5, 2].map((t) => <text x={X0 + t * PER_S} y="256" text-anchor="middle" class="tk">{t}</text>)}
    <text x={X0 + 2.1 * PER_S + 10} y="256" class="tk"><tspan data-lang-en>seconds</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>giây</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Fifty requests, forty threads: two rounds. The awaiting version has no pool to run out of.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Năm mươi request, bốn mươi thread: hai lượt. Bản dùng await không có pool nào để cạn.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep6j { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep6j-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep6j svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bep6j text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep6j .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep6j .code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }
  .bep6j .s { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep6j .v { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep6j .vr { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep6j .tk { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .bep6j .axis { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep6j .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .bep6j .ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep6j .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep6j .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep6j .arrow { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep6j .arrowr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep6j .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep6j .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep6j figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
